   "cooked": "<p>Over a year ago, before the hatch, I exported the chat-logs from our discord server and transformed them to simple markdown files, extracting all the links and listening them at the top for easy reference.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/TEC-INFO\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/favicons/favicon.svg\" width=\"32\"/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/TEC-INFO\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/345;\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb25618b8dcdc73e66cb143fe7d6da49f95be14f_2_10x10.png\" height=\"345\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb25618b8dcdc73e66cb143fe7d6da49f95be14f_2_690x345.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb25618b8dcdc73e66cb143fe7d6da49f95be14f_2_690x345.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/eb25618b8dcdc73e66cb143fe7d6da49f95be14f_2_1035x517.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/eb25618b8dcdc73e66cb143fe7d6da49f95be14f.png 2x\" width=\"690\"/></div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/TEC-INFO\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub - CommonsBuild/tec-info: Information about the Token Engineering Commons</a></h3>\n<p>Information about the Token Engineering Commons. Contribute to CommonsBuild/tec-info development by creating an account on GitHub.</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p>A lot has happened since then, so I decided to update that repository.</p>\n<p>You’ll find the chatlogs and the links in the <a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/tec-info/tree/main/wg-digest\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">wg-digest</a> directory.</p>\n<p>The links are arranged by working group txt chat they were found in, and have been roughly sorted into categories. Ideally I’ll find the time to sort them more thoroughly by topic, at some juncture, but Ive already allotted as much time as I have for the task at the moment.</p>\n<p>In the mean-time,  the working groups may find value in creating further community resources using these as a source.</p>",
